 evidence does not directly quantify why the decline should ease from about -145k to -124k.\",\"actionRequested\":\"State whether this is a judgmental inside-view adjustment and cite a concrete supporting indicator, or keep the persistence prior closer to the recent average.\"}],\"optionalSuggestions\":[\"Use exact official recent enrollment counts rather than rounded historical context values if available.\",\"Name the exact data.medicaid.gov dataset/table field used for Total Medicaid and CHIP Enrollment to reduce resolver ambiguity.\"]}\nrecords/thesis-analyst/2026-06-27/2026-06-27t13-34-28z-ons-labour-unemployment-rate-april-to-june-2026-first-print-apr-jun-2026/parsed_cells.json:20:        \"label\": \"Nov 2025-Jan 2026 unemployment rate, percent\",\nrecords/thesis-analyst/2026-06-27/2026-06-27t13-34-28z-ons-labour-unemployment-rate-april-to-june-2026-first-print-apr-jun-2026/draft_codex_events.jsonl:109:{\"type\": \"item.completed\", \"item\": {\"id\": \"item_53\", \"type\": \"agent_message\", \"text\": \"{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"uk-ons-unemployment-rate-apr-jun-2026-first-print\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"UK\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"data\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"UK unemployment Apr-Jun 2026\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"ONS UK unemployment rate for people aged 16 years and over, seasonally adjusted Labour Force Survey estimate, April to June 2026, first print\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"percent\\\",\\\"pointEstimate\\\":5.1,\\\"ciLow\\\":4.7,\\\"ciHigh\\\":5.5,\\\"confidence\\\":0.8,\\\"resolutionDate\\\":\\\"2026-08-11\\\",\\\"resolutionSource\\\":\\\"Office for National Statistics Labour market overview, UK: August 2026\\\",\\\"resolutionSourceUrl\\\":\\\"https://www.ons.gov.uk/releases/labourmarketoverviewukaugust2026\\\",\\\"resolutionRule\\\":\\\"Resolve to the first ONS-published UK unemployment rate for people aged 16 years and over for April to June 2026, seasonally adjusted, in the August 2026 Labour market overview or linked ONS time-series page. Use the one-decimal percent firs