road renewal-related terminations or a reporting break; above 78,900,000 would likely require a material state resubmission effect or a broad March enrollment rebound.\"},{\"kind\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Review disposition: accepted the resolver-date critique by tying resolution to the official March 2026 preliminary link dated June 26, 2026; accepted the interval critique by making the recent-change basis explicit; accepted the update critique by labeling the milder decline as a judgmental adjustment from the latest observed momentum.\"},{\"kind\":\"forecast\",\"point\":78060000,\"ciLow\":77250000,\"ciHigh\":78900000}]}\nrecords/thesis-analyst/2026-06-27/2026-06-27t13-21-11z-cms-medicaid-chip-total-enrollment-march-2026-fixed-vintage-march-2026-fixed-vintage/draft_codex_events.jsonl:6:{\"type\": \"item.completed\", \"item\": {\"id\": \"ws_0856b5b0f0d4a806016a3fce4f03a88195a43de05cf41f2e0b\", \"type\": \"web_search\", \"query\": \"site:medicaid.gov enrollment data March 2026 Medicaid CHIP total enrollment release calendar\", \"action\": {\"type\": \"search\", \"query\": \"site:medicaid.gov enrollment data March 2026 Medicaid CHIP total enrollment release calendar\", \"queries\": [\"site:medicaid.gov enrollment data March 2026 Medicaid CHIP total enrollment release calendar\", \"CMS Medicaid CHIP Enrollment Data March 2026 total enrollment\", \"medicaid.gov Medicaid CHIP Enrollment Data Highlights March 2026\"]}}}\nrecords/thesis-analyst/2026-06-27/2026-06-27t13-21-11z-cms-medicaid-chip-total-enrollment-march-2026-fixed-vintage-march-2026-fixed-vintage/draft_codex_events.jsonl:8:{\"type\": \"item.completed\", \"item\": {\"id\": \"ws_0856b5b0f0d4a806016a3fce516df0819595e937efc2bd5a61\", \"type\": \"web_search\", \"query\": \"Medicaid CHIP Enrollment Data monthly reports CMS 2026 March enrollment\", \"action\": {\"type\": \"search\", \"query\": \"Medicaid CHIP Enrollment Data monthly reports CMS 2026 March enrollment\", \"queries\": [\"Medicaid CHIP Enrollment Data monthl